    "report_markdown": "# Hypora run report: run_009f8bd01b94\n\n**Outcome:** a verified model.\n\n## Verification and limitations\n**Verification:** passed: every verifier check that ran passed.\nThe agent's text below does not change this verdict.\n\n**Skipped checks**\n| Check | Status | Detail |\n|---|---|---|\n| learned_transform_leakage | skipped | static analysis of fit/predict is not implemented (D-044 8.4; a mandatory report limitation) |\n\n**Limitations (written by the platform)**\n- The learned-transform leakage check is not implemented: transforms fitted inside a pipeline were not checked for leakage from the evaluation folds or the test split.\n- The plan was approved by policy (auto_within_contract) within the request's bounds, without a human decision.\n- The test split was scored once, for the final candidate only; every other trial has validation scores only.\n- The report has no agent narrative.\n\n**Approval:** approved by `policy:auto_within_contract` under policy `auto_within_contract` (contract v1); approval `appr_run_009f8bd01b94_plan_v1`, plan hash `f79bca858310`.\n\n## Task\n- Objective: Predict whether each university student will drop out, still be enrolled, or graduate by the end of the normal course duration, so that advisers can contact students at risk early. Each prediction is made at the end of the student's first semester, from the enrollment record, the student's background and economic context, and first-semester results; nothing recorded after the first semester is available when the prediction is made.\n- Target: `Target` (multiclass_classification)\n- Primary metric: `f1_macro` (maximize)\n\n_No narrative: the fixed-pipeline baseline makes no model calls._\n\n## Final model\n- Trial `trl_80f19ec4`: Default HistGradientBoosting on every column with a random split.\n- Verified: yes\n\n| Metric | Test (once) | Validation (mean) |\n|---|---|---|\n| f1_macro | 0.7141 | 0.6890 |\n| accuracy | 0.7786 | 0.7607 |\n| balanced_accuracy |