tract built by code, plan approved by policy.\n- Final candidate trl_80f19ec4: best mean validation f1_macro.\n- Final job job_1795302647164323819_a256ab: test split scored once; verifier v1 passed.\n\n## Sources\n- `task_spec:run_009f8bd01b94.v1`\n- `profile:run_009f8bd01b94.profile.12f234177d19`\n- `experiment_contract:run_009f8bd01b94.v1`\n- `result:trl_80f19ec4/test`\n"
